  "characterSheetPrompt": "A comprehensive character reference sheet for Sophia, featuring three full-body views: front, profile, and back, all presented against a pure white studio background with bright, even lighting. In the front view, Sophia stands upright, facing forward, with her arms relaxed at her sides and her hands visible. She wears a crisp, white, long-sleeved lab coat made of a cotton-blend, extending to just above her knees. The coat features a stand-up collar, a full button-front closure, a small chest pocket on the left, and two large patch pockets on the lower front. A silver and black stethoscope is draped around her neck. Her long, dark brown hair falls over her shoulders. The profile view shows her right side, revealing the full length of the lab coat, the stethoscope, and her long hair pulled back slightly. The back view clearly displays the full back of the white lab coat, including a horizontal back belt detail with two visible buttons, and the smooth flow of her long, dark brown hair down her back. All three views show her standing barefoot, with her feet clearly visible.",
