    "bust": "Generate a bust portrait of Sophia, a young adult woman, framed from the chest up, looking directly at the viewer. Her expression is neutral and professional, with a hint of seriousness. Her oval face features prominent cheekbones and a defined jawline. Her dark brown, almond-shaped eyes are direct and clear, complemented by well-defined, dark, slightly arched eyebrows. Her nose is straight and of medium size. Her lips are medium full with a natural pink hue, ensuring they are large and completely unobstructed for talking video. Her long, straight, dark brown hair is parted slightly off-center and cascades smoothly over her shoulders. She is dressed in a crisp, white, long-sleeved lab coat made from a cotton-blend fabric, featuring a stand-up collar and visible white buttons. A silver and black stethoscope is draped around her neck, with the earpieces resting on her shoulders. The lighting should be soft, even, and frontal, creating minimal shadows. The background should be a plain, light grey, allowing her face and upper body to be the central focus.",
    "fullBody": "Generate a full-body image of Sophia, a young adult woman, standing upright and facing forward, with her arms relaxed at her sides. The image must show one complete person, with both shoes visible, generous headroom, and no cropping. Her expression is neutral and professional. Her long, straight, dark brown hair is parted slightly off-center and falls over her shoulders. She is wearing a crisp, white, long-sleeved lab coat made of a cotton-blend fabric, which extends to just above her knees. The coat features a stand-up collar, a full button-front closure, a small chest pocket on the left, and two large patch pockets on the lower front. A silver and black stethoscope is draped around her neck, with the earpieces resting on her shoulders and the chest piece hanging centrally. She is wearing simple, professional white or black closed-toe shoes. The lighting should be bright and even, casting soft shadows. The background should be a plain, light grey, ensuring the focus remains entirely on Sophia and her attire."
